aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}].$ Find ${A}^{4}.$\n\n| ${A}^{4}=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, to find ${A}^{2},$ we multiply $A$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{2} & =A\\cdot A \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}14 & -10 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since ${A}^{4}={A}^{2}\\cdot {A}^{2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{4} & ={A}^{2}\\cdot {A}^{2} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}14 & -10 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}14 & -10 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}146 & -130 \\\\ 65 & -49\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-279435/field-1" "q-279435/field-2" "q-279435/field-3" "q-279435/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "82e970fe-cff8-50e3-9b94-67ad97b03da7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-279435"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130567/selection/623b3a7c028d12d73e5eae114f628da65ada1f3e77421aa733b4ac68bf4b3933" :answer/id #uuid "86097356-9125-5a73-85a9-a620254f9536" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -5 \\\\ 6 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130567/selection/756e3ceb9b61c292180259ab62eb264031d934ef1b0af02b56cfbb7183663d5e" :answer/id #uuid "0c3758f4-c941-511f-9bc7-85321ee6d35e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130567/selection/bf2a0360a5749bada62c56f2fd7219cd5f343ac6e85537783cde6a822c9179cb" :answer/id #uuid "2948e590-9d03-5c07-b420-b9356399716e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 6 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/valida