estion.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130681/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "61443225-bc08-5d36-a603-3a1d7e392a98"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130681"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-78579/selection/e93a168901e1ff546ab13ba78724c428c5a9409cc7adc5e8d69736f6401c2be8" :answer/id #uuid "deebe8ba-4cbd-5213-acbf-2f6166511716" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78579/selection/71f89853cf32da386c4ec501feaba02fd9eb91e3a6ad6ffbf35e16c19c836d73" :answer/id #uuid "4d5e43dd-0df5-5817-b220-edafa673571b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 6 \\\\ 6 & 6\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78579/selection/db3010b2eca9dfa1819e5cae1ea5bafdec37b7c897aabb5df63c69259372a134" :answer/id #uuid "e8385453-4da4-5e5c-8157-b962240c2827" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78579/selection/9c69366cde70004e4cd625198adb506a6b696cf1e3d03bba104c467c6e6f2ca0" :answer/id #uuid "c46300cf-c567-5485-82b9-a610934eb37b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78579/selection/51319135bacd0b831c93b8d34d6bd0347fe1851699cf2ee841cacf54ab3cb851" :answer/id #uuid "58840a4c-1185-5792-bdd0-49d26f774368" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-78579/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b173a634-e44e-52c6-b251-390f6fc71092" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-78579/selection/e93a168901e1ff546ab13ba78724c428c5a9409cc7adc5e8d69736f6401c2be8" :answer-field/choices ["q-78579/selection/e93a168901e1ff546ab13ba78724c428c5a9409cc7adc5e8d69736f6401c2be8" "q-78579/selection/71f89853cf32da386c4ec501feaba02fd9eb91e3a6ad6ffbf35e16c19c836d73" "q-78579/selection/db3010b2eca9dfa1819e5cae1ea5bafdec37b7c897aabb5df63c69259372a134" "q-78579/selection/9c69366cde70004e4cd625198adb506a6b696cf1e3d03bba104c467c6e6f2ca0" "q-78579/selection/51319135bacd0b831c93b8d34d6bd0347fe1851699cf2ee841cacf54ab3cb851"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-78579" :question/id #uuid "e05cccc7-ce0d-54fd-bb7a-4d21b6ea5fbb" :question/math-academy-id "q-78579" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $B=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}].$ Find $f(B)$ if $f(X)={X}^{2}-3X+4.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}-3X+4 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}-3X+4I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(B)={B}^{2}-3B+4I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${B}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{B}^{2} & =B\\cdot B \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 \\\\ -9 & 7\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(B):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(B) & ={B}^{2}-3B+4I \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 \\\\ -9 & 7\\end{aligned}]-3[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}]+4[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 \\\\ -9 & 7\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}3 & -3 \\\\ -9 & 6\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4-3+4 & -3-(-3)+0 \\\\ -9-(-9)+0 & 7-6+4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-78579/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "61443225-bc08-5d36-a603-3a1d7e392a98"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-78579"] :db/ensure [:knowle